
"smart_sources:Flora - Memory Books/116 - Two Hours of Softness.md": {"path":"Flora - Memory Books/116 - Two Hours of Softness.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1bel1nj","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777331018619,"size":4062,"at":1777331817893,"hash":"1bel1nj"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,23],"#116 - Two Hours of Softness":[25,26],"#116 - Two Hours of Softness#{1}":[26,26]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["intimate decompression","sensory bond exploration","vulnerability in stillness","family dynamics","the sealed hall","ryan adame","queen maya","palace of loth logan","althena"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**What it is:** A personal/historical record of a mandated decompression session involving Ryan Adame and his three wives (Florence, Charlotte, Estra) on June 21, 1843. Documents their difficulty disengaging from security/strategic mindsets, and an evolving intimate bonding ritual that transitions from awkward stillness to consensual group intimacy. Includes sensory link testing.\\n\\n**Select when:** The narrative or context involves: the Adame polycule's private dynamics; mandated decompression/rest protocols; characters struggling to be \\\"soft\\\" or non-strategic; sensory bond mechanics (shared tactile sensation); safeword use (\\\"Black\\\"); teaching inexperienced partners intimacy.\\n\\n**Key relationships:** Ryan Adame (husband, initiator), Florence (wife, hearth/grounding), Charlotte (wife, analytical/strategic), Estra (wife, security-focused, inexperienced). Family unit with hierarchical/command dynamics; sensory bond linking participants.","location":"Duran","scene_type":"recovery","character_present":["Ryan","Charlotte","Florence","Estra"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/116 - Two Hours of Softness.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"6e6poc","at":1777331817827},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/116 - Two Hours of Softness.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,23],"size":1358,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
